        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Hydrochloric acid from benzene chlorination, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Hydrochloric acid from benzene chlorination, at plant
The multioutput-process "benzene chlorination"  delivers the co-products monochlorobenzene, o-dichlorobenzene, p-dichlorobenzene, and hydrochloric acid. The allocation is based on mass balance.;
UUID: 5e86bbb2-cb95-3fac-9e84-1108b3b9bbda
Benzene chlorination including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for Europe.
Technology: Chlorination of benzene
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Transports are modelled with standard methods.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5e86bbb2-cb95-3fac-9e84-1108b3b9bbda.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
